      "writtenOn": "2024-07-01T23:04:35Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "how do notifications work with accessors? Are there any special cases? They are used to implement waitForService, so we may need to change it to give a notification to the client when an accessor for that service is registered as well, though that makes permissions complicated - maybe instead registerForNotification also requests for the accessor permissions?",
