        "id": 1958315
      },
      "writtenOn": "2024-07-08T12:00:04Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I\u0027ve added the accessor permission here. However, I think the notification would require a few more changes to make it work properly. Would you mind if I handle this in a separate cl?\n\nThe changes I have in mind are:\n\n- Change the `IServiceCallback#onRegistration(name, binder)` method to `IServiceCallback#onRegistration(name, Service)`.\n- Add a new API called \"ServiceManager_addAccessor\" all along the pipeline.\n  - In `addAccessor`, I\u0027ll call IServiceCallback#onRegistration(name, Service#accessor) to notify the caller.\n  - In the original `addService`, we call `call IServiceCallback#onRegistration(name, Service#binder)`\n\nWhen a caller invokes \"waitForService(serviceName)\", `BackendUnifiedServiceManager` will set up the RPC binder upon receiving Service#accessor in `onRegistration`.",
      "parentUuid": "bfe06cc6_53a61d9e",
      "range": {
